<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AMERICA ONLINE FEATURED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AMERICA ONLINE FEATURED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston analyst Alan Braverman said the firm named America Online Inc its &quot;featured stock of the week,&quot; reiterating a buy rating on the shares.</p>
<p>-- said has $78 18-month price target on the shares, which were up 10/16 at 70-9/16.</p>
